`--columns` projects each row down to the declared keys in declared order, always followed by
`path` and `slug`; keys the file carries but the projection omits — here `created` — are gone.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
status: ready-for-dev
created: 20260101
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md' --columns status,title --output json
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
[
  {
    "status": "ready-for-dev",
    "title": "Alpha",
    "path": "plans/alpha/index.md",
    "slug": "alpha"
  }
]
-- stderr --
